<p>
Some people tell me<br>
that I look through<br>
rose colored glasses,<br>
because life can&rsquo;t<br>
be that good.
</p>

<p>
All I know is that<br>
if my glass is only<br>
half full it&rsquo;s<br>
because I have<br>
drunk deeply<br>
from the<br>
joy,<br>
wonder,<br>
and<br>
love<br>
that is you.
</p>



